 large to be run. Stabbed on and leak tested QTS to 170 bar. Equalized across SV and HMV with MEG and opened well. SIWHP 102 bar.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2010-09-19T12:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2010-09-19T14:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">2980</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>equipment failure</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>RIH with BHA #3, 7&quot; EVO plug on tractor to 2980 m MDRKB. Had to work BHA through Baker AVLDM tubing hanger at 510 m.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2010-09-19T14:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2010-09-19T15:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">3030</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- wire line</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Activated tractor and RIH from 2980 to 3030 m.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2010-09-19T15:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2010-09-19T17:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">3264.6</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- wire line</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Performed correlation passes. Set EVO plug with pkg. element at 3274,8 m and top plug at 3274,25 m.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2010-09-19T17:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2010-09-19T18:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- wire line</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>POOH with BHA #3.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2010-09-19T18:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2010-09-19T21:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- rig up/down</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Closed well. WHP = 99 bar. Held toolbox meeting on drill floor. Inflow tested HMV. Bled off and flushed lubricator with N2. LD and checked toolstring.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2010-09-19T21:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2010-09-19T22:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- wait</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Time out meeting in PCR with focus on communication.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2010-09-19T22:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2010-09-20T00:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- rig up/down</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Held SJA meeting on drill floor regarding RD. Closed DHSV and bled down pressure above to 63 bar through flowline to test sep. Meanwhile LD lubricator onto HTS.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity>
